---
/**
 * BucketsSection — Two-column "The Three Buckets" section (Figma node 176:20).
 *
 * Left:  pull-quote (Fraunces h3, accent on middle phrase) +
 *        "Four rules that make this work" heading + numbered body rules.
 * Right: Three bucket cards using Card variant="bordered" stacked with
 *        vertical connector lines.
 *
 * Card shadow tokens (from brand.ts):
 *   Bucket 01 → shadow-card      (3px 3px 0 secondary/#7BA3BD)
 *   Bucket 02 → shadow-card-mist (3px 3px 0 cardMist/#E4EDF2)
 *   Bucket 03 → shadow-card-pink (3px 3px 0 ctaPink/#F2E4E4)
 *
 * Used on /fill-the-first-bucket.
 */
import Card from '~/components/ui/Card.astro';
---

<section class="not-prose w-full py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-[80px]">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-container flex-col gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 md:flex-row md:gap-16 md:px-16 lg:gap-[64px] lg:px-[120px]">

    {/* ── LEFT: pull-quote + rules ── */}
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-10 md:gap-[64px]">

      {/* Pull quote */}
      <p class="font-heading text-h3 font-normal leading-[1.2] text-heading">
        The price goes up as the evidence goes down. Bucket one is free and it is the one that matters most.{' '}
        <span class="text-accent">Bucket three costs thousands and may do nothing at all.</span>{' '}
        Almost nobody in this business will tell you that, because most of them sell bucket three.
      </p>

      {/* Four rules */}
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-normal leading-none text-heading">
          Four rules that make<br class="hidden sm:block" /> this work.
        </h2>
        <div class="font-sans text-small leading-[1.3] text-muted space-y-[1.3em]">
          <p>
            <strong class="font-bold">1. Overflow, not completion.</strong>{' '}
            You never &ldquo;finish&rdquo; a bucket. You fill it as well as you reasonably can, and what spills over (spare money, spare attention, spare Tuesdays) runs down to the next. Nobody is being told to wait.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="font-bold">2. Inside bucket one there is no order. </strong>
            The buckets are a sequence; the four pillars inside bucket one are not. Show up for any one, stay for all four. Start with whichever you can face on a Tuesday.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="font-bold">3. The buckets refill.</strong>{' '}
            Bucket one is a permanent habit, not a phase you graduate from. You do not stop walking because you have moved on to blood tests.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="font-bold">4. We are not against bucket three. </strong>
            Recreational anti-aging is fine. If you enjoy it and can afford it, help yourself, the same as a weekend in Las Vegas. The objection is buying bucket three while bucket one sits empty.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* ── RIGHT: three bucket cards ── */}
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-stretch gap-0">

      {/* ── Bucket 01: The Basics ── */}
      <Card
        variant="bordered"
        label="fill this first"
        labelBg="bg-card-mist"
        labelTextColor="text-accent"
        class="shadow-card w-full"
      >
        <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4 px-4 pt-2">
          {/* Number + title + description */}
          <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5 font-heading text-h3 leading-none">
              <span class="text-accent">01</span>
              <span class="text-heading">The Basics</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-sans text-[12px] leading-[1.3] text-primary">
              Move. Eat well. Sleep. Stay connected. That&rsquo;s it. That&rsquo;s the bucket, and it is the one with the strongest evidence in all of longevity medicine. It costs you a calendar, not a credit card.
            </p>
          </div>
          {/* Meta badges */}
          <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-2.5 pt-1 opacity-40">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="1" y="3.5" width="12" height="8.5" rx="1.5" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <path d="M1 6h12" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <circle cx="9.5" cy="8.5" r="1" fill="#2C4A5B"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-primary">free</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M7 1l1.5 3.5H12l-2.8 2 1.1 3.5L7 8l-3.3 2 1.1-3.5L2 4.5h3.5L7 1z" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-primary">strongest evidence</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {/* CTA */}
        <div class="px-4">
          <a
            href="/fill-the-first-bucket"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 py-4 font-sans text-[14px] font-semibold leading-none text-white transition-colors hover:bg-heading"
          >
            The four pillars
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>

      {/* Connector line 01→02 */}
      <div class="mx-auto h-10 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-[#7BA3BD] to-[#E4EDF2]"></div>

      {/* ── Bucket 02: Measure & ask ── */}
      <Card
        variant="bordered"
        label="then this"
        labelBg="bg-card-mist"
        labelTextColor="text-accent"
        class="shadow-card-mist w-full"
      >
        <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4 px-4 pt-2">
          <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5 font-heading text-h3 leading-none">
              <span class="text-accent">02</span>
              <span class="text-heading">Measure &amp; ask</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-sans text-[12px] leading-[1.3] text-primary">
              Blood pressure. A1c. Kidney and liver function. DEXA. Coronary calcium. Hearing. Cheap, mostly covered, and almost never ordered unless somebody asks, plus the question hardly anyone asks: do I still need all these medications?
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-2.5 pt-1 opacity-40">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="1" y="3.5" width="12" height="8.5" rx="1.5" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <path d="M1 6h12" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <circle cx="9.5" cy="8.5" r="1" fill="#2C4A5B"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-primary">mostly covered</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M7 1l1.5 3.5H12l-2.8 2 1.1 3.5L7 8l-3.3 2 1.1-3.5L2 4.5h3.5L7 1z" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-primary">moderate evidence</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="px-4">
          <a
            href="/talk-to-your-doctor"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 py-4 font-sans text-[14px] font-semibold leading-none text-white transition-colors hover:bg-heading"
          >
            What to ask your doctor
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>

      {/* Connector line 02→03 */}
      <div class="mx-auto h-10 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-[#E4EDF2] to-[#F2E4E4]"></div>

      {/* ── Bucket 03: The fancy stuff ── */}
      <Card
        variant="bordered"
        label="and then this. but most people start here."
        labelBg="bg-cta-pink"
        labelTextColor="text-cta-pink"
        class="shadow-card-pink w-full"
      >
        <div class="flex w-full items-start gap-4 px-4 py-2">
          <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5 font-heading text-h3 leading-none">
              <span class="text-accent">03</span>
              <span class="text-heading">The fancy stuff</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-sans text-[12px] leading-[1.3] text-primary">
              IV drips, peptides, whole-body MRI, cancer panels, chambers, a stack of fifty supplements. Sometimes real, often theatre, always expensive. Fine once the first two are full, and that is the only claim we make about it.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-2.5 pt-1 opacity-40">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <rect x="1" y="3.5" width="12" height="8.5" rx="1.5" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <path d="M1 6h12" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                <circle cx="9.5" cy="8.5" r="1" fill="#2C4A5B"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-primary">thousands</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M7 1l1.5 3.5H12l-2.8 2 1.1 3.5L7 8l-3.3 2 1.1-3.5L2 4.5h3.5L7 1z" stroke="#2C4A5B" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-primary">weakest evidence</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {/* No CTA on bucket 03 — intentional per Figma */}
      </Card>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
